Story       Bullish engulfing candle
Trading     btc/usdt perpetuals on bitunix, 12m

  Given     price is below the VWAP
  When      the candle closes as a bullish engulfing candle
  And       the candle before was bearish
  And       the next candle after the engulfing closes above
            the engulfing's close
  And       the engulfing's low is above the previous candle's low
  Then      go long
  With      100 USD position size, 10x leverage
  SL        initially at the engulfing candle low
            once the price is at the VWAP, move SL to the VWAP
            & keep moving it to track the VWAP

  Until     bearish engulfing candle closes
  Taking    100%

  Or until  Quadzilla super-down or Stoch cross down
  Taking    100%
     
